        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.099Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.099Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4323,
        "sentence_en": "Subscription prices range from ten to fifty dollars monthly.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قیمت اشتراک ماهیانه از ده تا پنجاه دلار متغیر است.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.103Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.103Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4324,
        "sentence_en": "Each client receives a separate dashboard and login page.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هر مشتری یک داشبورد و صفحه ورود جداگانه دریافت می کند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.127Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.127Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4325,
        "sentence_en": "Our multi-tenant app gives every company its own branding.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برنامه چند مستاجری ما به هر شرکت برند مخصوص خودش را می دهد.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.146Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.146Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4326,
        "sentence_en": "We compared three approaches before rebuilding the dashboard.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما پیش از بازسازی داشبورد سه روش را مقایسه کردیم.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.149Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.149Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4327,
        "sentence_en": "Each route group uses a different layout file.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هر گروه مسیر از یک فایل چیدمان متفاوت استفاده می کند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.171Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.171Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4328,
        "sentence_en": "The optional note appears in parentheses after the title.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یادداشت اختیاری پس از عنوان داخل پرانتز ظاهر می شود.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.177Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.177Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4329,
        "sentence_en": "Store shared images in the public directory.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تصاویر مشترک را در دایرکتوری عمومی ذخیره کنید.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.189Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.189Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4330,
        "sentence_en": "This section contains settings for billing and security.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این بخش شامل تنظیمات صورتحساب و امنیت است.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.196Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.196Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4331,
        "sentence_en": "The URL path stays unchanged after the redirect.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مسیر نشانی اینترنتی پس از تغییر مسیر بدون تغییر باقی می ماند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.216Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.216Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4332,
        "sentence_en": "Dynamic theming lets each client use custom colors and fonts.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تم بندی پویا به هر مشتری اجازه می دهد از رنگ ها و فونت های سفارشی استفاده کند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.244Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.244Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4333,
        "sentence_en": "The SaaS platform serves hundreds of small online stores.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلتفرم نرم افزار به عنوان سرویس به صدها فروشگاه آنلاین کوچک خدمات می دهد.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.250Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.250Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4334,
        "sentence_en": "The final design is based on customer feedback.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "طراحی نهایی بر اساس بازخورد مشتری است.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.281Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.281Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4335,
        "sentence_en": "Each store can use its own branded subdomain.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هر فروشگاه می تواند از زیردامنه برند شده خودش استفاده کند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.287Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.287Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4336,
        "sentence_en": "Every tenant has separate users, settings, and billing records.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هر مستاجر سامانه کاربران، تنظیمات و سوابق صورتحساب جداگانه دارد.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.307Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.307Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4337,
        "sentence_en": "Save the database configuration in an environment file.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پیکربندی پایگاه داده را در یک فایل محیطی ذخیره کنید.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.329Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.329Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4338,
        "sentence_en": "The root server component loads the theme before rendering children.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کامپوننت سرور ریشه پیش از رندر کردن فرزندان تم را بارگذاری می کند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.334Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.334Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4339,
        "sentence_en": "The parent component passes the settings down to every page.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کامپوننت والد تنظیمات را به کامپوننت های پایین تر در هر صفحه انتقال می دهد.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.386Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.386Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4340,
        "sentence_en": "A CSS variable controls the main background color.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک متغیر CSS رنگ اصلی پس زمینه را کنترل می کند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.393Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.393Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4341,
        "sentence_en": "A micro-frontend lets one team deploy its section independently.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک میکرو فرانت اند به یک تیم اجازه می دهد بخش خود را مستقل مستقر کند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.418Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.418Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4342,
        "sentence_en": "We use a multi-zone setup for separate company portals.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما برای پورتال های جداگانه شرکت از یک ساختار چند ناحیه ای استفاده می کنیم.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.423Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.423Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4343,
        "sentence_en": "The enterprise application handles payroll, inventory, and customer accounts.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برنامه سازمانی حقوق و دستمزد، موجودی و حساب های مشتریان را مدیریت می کند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.429Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.429Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4344,
        "sentence_en": "Our design system keeps buttons and forms consistent everywhere.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سیستم طراحی ما دکمه ها و فرم ها را در همه جا هماهنگ نگه می دارد.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.434Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.434Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4345,
        "sentence_en": "The team chose a lightweight framework for the new portal.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تیم یک چارچوب سبک برای پورتال جدید انتخاب کرد.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.441Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.441Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4346,
        "sentence_en": "Both applications run under the same company domain.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هر دو برنامه زیر دامنه یکسان شرکت اجرا می شوند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.487Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.487Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4347,
        "sentence_en": "Configure the server before deploying the application.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پیش از استقرار برنامه، سرور را پیکربندی کنید.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.494Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.494Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4348,
        "sentence_en": "We merged both dashboards into one customer portal.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما هر دو داشبورد را در یک پورتال مشتری ادغام کردیم.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.507Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.507Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4349,
        "sentence_en": "The routing tree shows how requests reach each page.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "درخت مسیریابی نشان می دهد درخواست ها چگونه به هر صفحه می رسند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.597Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.597Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4350,
        "sentence_en": "Check the official documentation before changing the configuration.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پیش از تغییر پیکربندی، مستندات رسمی را بررسی کنید.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.603Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.603Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4351,
        "sentence_en": "Component-level switching lets us show different checkout designs.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جابه جایی در سطح کامپوننت به ما اجازه می دهد طراحی های متفاوت پرداخت را نمایش دهیم.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.608Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.608Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4352,
        "sentence_en": "The product team uses A/B testing to compare signup pages.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تیم محصول از آزمایش A/B برای مقایسه صفحه های ثبت نام استفاده می کند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.614Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.614Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4353,
        "sentence_en": "Users can toggle between light and dark modes.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کاربران می توانند بین حالت روشن و تاریک تغییر دهند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.661Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.661Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4354,
        "sentence_en": "We tested a simpler layout variant on mobile users.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما یک نوع متفاوت و ساده تر از چیدمان را روی کاربران موبایل آزمایش کردیم.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.673Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.673Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4355,
        "sentence_en": "This prop controls whether the sidebar stays open.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این ویژگی ورودی کامپوننت کنترل می کند که نوار کناری باز بماند یا نه.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.680Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.680Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4356,
        "sentence_en": "A dynamic import loads the editor only when needed.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک ایمپورت پویا ویرایشگر را فقط هنگام نیاز بارگذاری می کند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.686Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.686Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4357,
        "sentence_en": "The component tree becomes harder to manage as features grow.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "با افزایش قابلیت ها، مدیریت درخت کامپوننت سخت تر می شود.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.727Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.727Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4358,
        "sentence_en": "We narrowed down the options to two practical designs.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما گزینه ها را به دو طراحی کاربردی محدود کردیم.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.731Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.731Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4359,
        "sentence_en": "The server executes the task after validating the request.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سرور پس از اعتبارسنجی درخواست، وظیفه را اجرا می کند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.736Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.736Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4360,
        "sentence_en": "Improving checkout speed is our primary goal this quarter.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بهبود سرعت پرداخت هدف اصلی ما در این فصل است.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.742Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.742Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4361,
        "sentence_en": "The main use case is managing multiple customer accounts.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مورد استفاده اصلی، مدیریت چندین حساب مشتری است.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.747Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.747Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4362,
        "sentence_en": "The company expanded its e-commerce business into Canada.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت تجارت الکترونیک خود را به کانادا گسترش داد.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.753Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.753Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4363,
        "sentence_en": "This browser supports the latest CSS features.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این مرورگر از جدیدترین قابلیت های CSS پشتیبانی می کند.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.760Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.760Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4364,
        "sentence_en": "The page updates dynamically when the user changes themes.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هنگامی که کاربر تم ها را تغییر می دهد، صفحه به صورت پویا به روز می شود.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.764Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.764Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4365,
        "sentence_en": "We stopped by the food mart after work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما بعد از کار به بازار غذا سر زدیم.",
        "mentionedWordsJson": null,
        "items": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-06-13T22:10:05.332Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-13T22:10:05.332Z"
      }
